{"id":"1ae6d4638a7863b4","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-pcf4-shelah-filter.md","title":"ZFC Pcf4 Shelah Filter","display":"df-zfc-pcf4-shelah-filter — ZFC Pcf4 Shelah Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-shelah-filter","aliases":["58-df-zfc-pcf4-shelah-filter"],"display":"df-zfc-pcf4-shelah-filter — ZFC Pcf4 Shelah Filter","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-pcf4-shelah-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-pcf4-shelah-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-pcf4-shelah-filter — ZFC Pcf4 Shelah Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"390d99173de7c15c\" href=\"?note=390d99173de7c15c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f7fe6d0b50ba7f69\" href=\"?note=f7fe6d0b50ba7f69\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,F\\in V\">\\(A,F\\in V\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\">\\(F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ShelahFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ShelahFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"390d99173de7c15c\" href=\"?note=390d99173de7c15c\" title=\"58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md\">58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f7fe6d0b50ba7f69\" href=\"?note=f7fe6d0b50ba7f69\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md\">../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" href=\"?note=5a7d94a7a7f8209a\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md\">../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ShelahFilter}_S(A,F)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S(A)\\land|A|&lt;\\min A\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists S,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(A,S)\n\\land\\lambda\\in S\\land\\forall\\mu\\in S\\;(\\mu\\leq\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}{}\\land\nF=\\Bigl\\{X\\subseteq A\\,\\Bigm|\\,\nA\\setminus X=\\varnothing\\ \\lor\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{41mm}\n\\exists S_X\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(A\\setminus X,S_X)\n\\land\\bigcup S_X&lt;\\lambda\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,A)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ShelahFilter}_S(A,F)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S(A)\\land|A|&lt;\\min A\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists S,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(A,S)\n\\land\\lambda\\in S\\land\\forall\\mu\\in S\\;(\\mu\\leq\\lambda)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{16mm}{}\\land\nF=\\Bigl\\{X\\subseteq A\\,\\Bigm|\\,\nA\\setminus X=\\varnothing\\ \\lor\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{41mm}\n\\exists S_X\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(A\\setminus X,S_X)\n\\land\\bigcup S_X&lt;\\lambda\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,A)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n<li>The maximum is expressed by membership and an upper-bound clause, and every nonempty complement gets its own registered PCF-spectrum witness. Thus neither a partial <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\max\">\\(\\max\\)</span> term nor an out-of-domain use of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pcf}\">\\(\\operatorname{pcf}\\)</span> remains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"390d99173de7c15c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md","status":"resolved","id":"f7fe6d0b50ba7f69","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"390d99173de7c15c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S\\subseteq V$ (see [[58-df-zfc-pcf2-regular-cardinal-set.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md","status":"resolved","id":"f7fe6d0b50ba7f69","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-zfc-pcf3-pcf-spectrum.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"5a7d94a7a7f8209a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-filter-set.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ShelahFilter}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}pcf4\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}filter}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf4ShelahFilter}_S(A,F)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf2RegularCardinalSet}_S(A)\\land|A|<\\min A\\\\\n&{}\\land\\exists S,\\lambda\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(A,S)\n\\land\\lambda\\in S\\land\\forall\\mu\\in S\\;(\\mu\\leq\\lambda)\\\\\n&\\hspace{16mm}{}\\land\nF=\\Bigl\\{X\\subseteq A\\,\\Bigm|\\,\nA\\setminus X=\\varnothing\\ \\lor\\\\\n&\\hspace{41mm}\n\\exists S_X\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcPcf3PcfSpectrum}_S(A\\setminus X,S_X)\n\\land\\bigcup S_X<\\lambda\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,A)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\max","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pcf}","display":false}],"bytes":1749,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3093","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-pcf4-shelah-filter.md|58-df-zfc-pcf4-shelah-filter]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","390d99173de7c15c","f7fe6d0b50ba7f69","5a7d94a7a7f8209a"]}